            {
              "content": "=You are an IT support manager.\n\nAnalyze the following customer support request.\n\nCustomer Name:\n{{$json.body.customerName}}\n\nCustomer Email:\n{{$json.body.customerEmail}}\n\nIssue:\n{{$json.body.issue}}\n\nYour task is to classify the ticket.\n\nRules:\n\n- If the issue mentions website down, server down, payment failure, security breach, database crash, hacked website, customers cannot order, or business cannot operate, set priority to \"High\".\n\n- Otherwise set priority to \"Normal\".\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format.\n\n{\n  \"category\": \"Website Outage\",\n  \"priority\": \"High\",\n  \"summary\": \"Customer website is down and customers cannot place orders.\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Return ONLY JSON.\n- Do NOT use markdown.\n- Do NOT wrap the JSON inside ``` blocks.\n- Do NOT add explanations.\n- Do NOT add extra fields.\n- The priority value must ONLY be \"High\" or \"Normal\"."
            }
          ]
        },
